# Line endings, kept as each file needs them whatever Git's settings on the machine:
# the .bat files are stored byte for byte (CRLF, as tools/make_launchers.py writes them;
# cmd misreads labels and "goto" in a batch file with LF only), the .sh files always LF
# (bash fails on a CR at the end of a line).
*.bat -text
*.sh  text eol=lf
